			title: "Hanging"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"This sorry killing must end at once! I waste so much of an animal's meat because I don't know what to do with its carcass!"
				""
				"&4It sounds like you must become your own butcher, then. You will be able to make so much more out of an animal's meat and even extract blood efficiently."
				""
				"Without my servants, I guess that is what I must do. Where do we start?"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "vampiresdelight:blood_wine_bottle"
