		}
		{
			dependencies: ["623C14C05294EFCC"]
			description: [
				"So, Grisha.. what do I do with a meat grinder?"
				""
				"&4Sausages!"
				""
				"Really? Sausages?"
				""
				"&4They're a sanguine delicacy, I'll have you know! Your grandfather was quite fond of them."
