		{
			dependencies: ["63F1C9A1095AEC1E"]
			description: [
				"Draining chickens and processing their carcasses sure is time consuming..."
				""
				"&4Keep this up and you could get a wish granted."
				""
				"A wish?"
				""
				"&4Old rumours were that a chicken's intact wishbone can be imbued with a Nether Star to grant immense power, granting a wish. Of course, I can't tell how exaggerated this was, but this might be worth looking into."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			id: "23E9BE6DF9CD5AA7"
			rewards: [{
				id: "51CFB301ECD9312C"
				type: "xp_levels"
